            <field>
              <name>FPIF15</name>
              <description>configurable event input 15 falling edge pending bit.
When EXTI2_SECCFGR1.SEC15 is disabled, FPIF15 can be accessed with non-secure and secure access.
When EXTI2_SECCFGR1.SEC15 is enabled, FPIF15 can only be accessed with secure access. Non-secure write to this FPIF15 is discarded, non-secure read returns 0.
When EXTI2_PRIVCFGR1.PRIV15 is disabled, FPIF15 can be accessed with unprivileged and privilege access.
When EXTI2_PRIVCFGR1.PRIV15 is enabled, FPIF15 can only be accessed with privilege access. Unprivileged write to this FPIF15 is discarded, unprivileged read returns 0.
When CID filtering is disabled in EXTI2_E15CIDCFGR this FPIF15 can be accessed by any processor CID.
When CID filtering is enabled in EXTI2_E15CIDCFGR this FPIF15 can only be accessed by the allowed processor CID. Dis allowed CID write to this FPIF15 is discarded and read returns 0.
This bit is set when the falling edge event arrives on the configurable event line. This bit is cleared by writing a 1 into the bit.</description>
