When EXTI2_SECCFGR2.SEC63 is enabled, PRIV63 can only be accessed with secure access. Non-secure write to this PRIV63 is discarded.
When CID filtering is disabled in EXTI2_E63CIDCFGR this PRIV63 can be accessed by any processor CID.
When CID filtering is enabled in EXTI2_E63CIDCFGR this PRIV63 can only be accessed by the allowed processor CID. Dis allowed CID write to this PRIV63 is discarded and read returns 0.</description>
