- When the semaphore is unlocked (LOCK bit written to 0 or AHB bus master ID or CID does not match LOCKID and/or SEC or PRIV do not match AHB bus master protection, the LOCKID is not affected.
- Write when LOCK bit is already 1 (semaphore locked), the LOCKID is not affected.
