This bit is updated, with the CID filtering information in HSEM_GpCIDCFGR.CFEN and HSEM_CnCIDCFGR.CFEN, by HW when semaphore is locked. This bit is set only when CID filtering is enabled for at least one CID in both HSEM_GpCIDCFGR.CFEN and HSEM_CnCIDCFGR.CFEN. Read only by software.</description>
