This bit is updated by hardware when semaphore is locked with the CID filtering information in HSEM_GpCIDCFGR.CFEN and HSEM_CnCIDCFGR.CFEN. This bit is set only when CID filtering is enabled for at least one CID in both HSEM_GpCIDCFGR.CFEN and HSEM_CnCIDCFGR.CFEN.</description>
